ssed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"bdd5c9fbbda266c35049409c516513d41e4d5b3573d4414c237c48adf9c70ef7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.1/chat.md","size_bytes":4352},"commits":{"digest":"d1bd13c31284671f162036404e34430d57961c025162f230207957d36cd4cfef","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.1/commits.json","size_bytes":219},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"fecd8f1143692dc9c65c5e338b0e0372bc9bfc58676e54d394cc4495e22e02c5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.1/meta.json","size_bytes":6300},"prompt":{"digest":"4f3dc66c32076220f685e47052ecf4447c9174c4e1e7bd662df7e84df12b92da","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":183},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"18e2127f461d52a04f3e7ae9a1a98cfcc9c8314e30b49e309b87f476ad1dea7c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":7627},"state":{"digest":"51e68077acf09159e3ad0085e4825056f65dd71e64dde57a63992e053d46a70d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-10-15T16:40:51.426524+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.1","local_name":"bob-cli-7v.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-7v","agent_clan_generation":"20261015123129","bead_id":"bob-cli-7v.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-7v[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Several URLs, one reference: multi-URL bob ref create collections[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bob ref create URL URL…` merges 2 to 20 web articles, in argument [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]order, into one Highlights-ready PDF and one reference. The PDF has[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a contents page, one bookmark per article, and continuous page [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]numbers. The name comes from `-N` or from the words every URL's [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]slug shares. The command is all-or-nothing and fails fast, before [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]any network call, whenever no trustworthy name exists.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ref_create_multi_url_collections.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/ref_create_multi_url_collections.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-7v[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-7v/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]List-aware import dedupe for source_url and url lists[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]dedupe[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dedupe: record one dedupe source per item of a list-valued [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source_url/url in ref notes and intake markers, so create, ingest, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture routing, and find -i see every URL of a list; delete the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documented gap in docs/ref.md.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure collection naming and metadata rules[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]naming[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]naming: add a network-free module implementing the slug-word naming rule[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with its no-name reasons, the name waterfall, the part-order warning, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the collection title/author/published derivation, all table-tested.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Adapter render:false capture, compose op, and the collection [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]layout[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]adapter[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adapter: let capture skip printing, add a compose op that typesets [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ordered article.json parts into one PDF (opening page, linked contents, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a fresh page and bookmark per part, namespaced ids and assets), plus the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rust client types; single-capture requests stay byte-identical.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Variadic TARGET, fail-fast validation, and collection overlap [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]policy[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after dedupe, naming[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate: make TARGET variadic, route two or more targets into a new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collection module that runs every pre-network check (kinds, -H, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicates, cap, name waterfall, overlap, target plan) with polished [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]errors, and rewrite the -N/TARGET help; the route itself is a stub until[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the next phase.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Collection route - classify, capture, compose, stamp, install,[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]report[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]route[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate, adapter[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]route: replace the stub with the all-or-nothing pipeline (per-part [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]classification, sequential render:false captures, metadata derivation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compose, list-valued marker, stamp, guarded install), dry-run and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]success reports, explicit --audio, and fake-adapter integration tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Narrate and attach collections with --listen[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]listen[dim] · [dim][/dim]after route[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]listen: support -L for collections by narrating the staged collection [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]PDF before the guarded install, and attach a new episode when the exact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]same URL set is already captured or queued.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, live verification, and follow-ups[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after listen[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document several-URL collections in the create, clip, and ref [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, run a live end-to-end check in a scratch vault on athena, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record follow-ups (plus the optional decisions strand).[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-7v","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-7v.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a01f3ad03d7118edf1219e2b97f09564","started_at":"2026-10-15T16:32:41.282014+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"98b7a57df3782e96cf35df2e03acc630c2095668dcb273383782c0633886ea8b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"8a9823a92703818d08aad3815fc3c4292e2d8a93c0f3548649b8c10976aa0bec","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-7v.5/meta.json","size_bytes":699},"prompt":{"digest":"4a08ebaeb77f92bd699b823b4afa6399f257d6d59a004678a399b8c4b0f3